                                                "sense_id": "58fd2814-a7c5-3074-8bd9-f3e0e38e6aa6",
                                                "text": "In all the sexual encounters I have participated in or know of the \"M\" sets the limits as to what to get into and how much pain will be applied. And of course if the scene gets too rough the \"M\" has the right to stop it."
                                            }
